MIGRATION SCENARIO WALKTHROUGH
================================================================================

SCENARIO: User has existing native installation and upgrades to sentinel mode

1. BEFORE MIGRATION (Native Mode)
   File: /etc/armorclaw/.env
   ```
   ARMORCLAW_SERVER_MODE=native
   ARMORCLAW_ADMIN_TOKEN=existing_admin_token_abc
   ARMORCLAW_KEYSTORE_SECRET=existing_keystore_secret_xyz
   ARMORCLAW_MATRIX_SECRET=existing_matrix_secret_123
   ARMORCLAW_RPC_TRANSPORT=unix
   ARMORCLAW_MATRIX_HOMESERVER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:6167
   ```

2. USER RUNS INSTALLER WITH DOMAIN
   Command: bash install.sh
   Input: DOMAIN=armorclaw.example.com

3. INSTALLER EXECUTION
   a) Domain detection → MODE=sentinel
   b) generate_secrets() runs:
      - Finds existing .env file ✅
      - Reads existing secrets ✅
      - Preserves all three secrets ✅
      - Logs "Preserved existing ARMORCLAW_XXX" ✅
   c) generate_env_file() runs:
      - Backs up .env to .env.backup.YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS ✅
      - Generates new .env with:
        * ARMORCLAW_SERVER_MODE=sentinel ✅
        * ARMORCLAW_ADMIN_TOKEN=existing_admin_token_abc (PRESERVED) ✅
        * ARMORCLAW_KEYSTORE_SECRET=existing_keystore_secret_xyz (PRESERVED) ✅
        * ARMORCLAW_MATRIX_SECRET=existing_matrix_secret_123 (PRESERVED) ✅
        * ARMORCLAW_RPC_TRANSPORT=tcp ✅
        * ARMORCLAW_LISTEN_ADDR=0.0.0.0:8080 ✅
        * ARMORCLAW_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://armorclaw.example.com ✅
        * ARMORCLAW_EMAIL=admin@example.com ✅
        * ARMORCLAW_MATRIX_HOMESERVER_URL=https://armorclaw.example.com:6167 ✅
   d) generate_caddyfile() runs:
      - Generates Caddyfile from template ✅
      - Substitutes DOMAIN_NAME and ADMIN_EMAIL ✅
   e) build_compose_cmd() runs:
      - Adds --profile sentinel to command ✅

4. AFTER MIGRATION (Sentinel Mode)
   File: /etc/armorclaw/.env
   ```
   ARMORCLAW_SERVER_MODE=sentinel                    ✅ Changed
   ARMORCLAW_ADMIN_TOKEN=existing_admin_token_abc   ✅ PRESERVED
   ARMORCLAW_KEYSTORE_SECRET=existing_keystore_secret_xyz  ✅ PRESERVED
   ARMORCLAW_MATRIX_SECRET=existing_matrix_secret_123    ✅ PRESERVED
   ARMORCLAW_RPC_TRANSPORT=tcp                       ✅ Changed
   ARMORCLAW_LISTEN_ADDR=0.0.0.0:8080                ✅ Added
   ARMORCLAW_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://armorclaw.example.com  ✅ Added
   ARMORCLAW_EMAIL=admin@example.com                ✅ Added
   ARMORCLAW_MATRIX_HOMESERVER_URL=https://armorclaw.example.com:6167  ✅ Changed
   ```

5. RESULT
   ✅ All secrets preserved
   ✅ Keystore.db remains accessible
   ✅ Matrix data remains accessible
   ✅ Configuration upgraded to sentinel mode
   ✅ Backup file created for recovery

