BEFORE vs AFTER COMPARISON
================================================================================

BEFORE FIX (Commit 52fee54):
  generate_secrets():
    ADMIN_TOKEN=$(generate_admin_token)      ❌ ALWAYS NEW
    KEYSTORE_SECRET=$(generate_keystore_secret)  ❌ ALWAYS NEW
    MATRIX_SECRET=$(generate_matrix_secret)      ❌ ALWAYS NEW

  Result:
    ❌ All secrets replaced during migration
    ❌ Keystore.db becomes inaccessible
    ❌ All encrypted data lost
    ❌ Complete data loss

AFTER FIX:
  generate_secrets():
    if [[ -f "$env_file" ]]; then            ✅ Check for existing
        ADMIN_TOKEN=$(grep ... "$env_file")  ✅ Read existing
        KEYSTORE_SECRET=$(grep ... "$env_file")  ✅ Read existing
        MATRIX_SECRET=$(grep ... "$env_file")    ✅ Read existing
    fi

    if [[ -z "$ADMIN_TOKEN" ]]; then         ✅ Only generate if missing
        ADMIN_TOKEN=$(generate_admin_token)
    else
        print_info "Preserved existing ARMORCLAW_ADMIN_TOKEN"  ✅ Log preservation
    fi
    (Same for KEYSTORE_SECRET and MATRIX_SECRET)

  Result:
    ✅ Existing secrets preserved
    ✅ Only missing secrets generated
    ✅ Keystore.db remains accessible
    ✅ All data intact
    ✅ Safe migration path

